  <categoryEntries>
    <categoryEntry id="9a01-bae4-a01d-7e02" name="Chapter" hidden="false">
      <profiles>
        <profile id="de68-bd77-2ad1-7694" name=" Righterous zeal" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="4108-a6f8-f259-35d5" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- You can re-roll Advance rolls and charge rolls made for units with this tactic.
- Each time a model with this tactic would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="4d71-967f-d91f-6d9f" name="Red thirst" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="897f-25a8-7032-e0f4" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to Advance rolls and charge rolls made for units with this tactic.
- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack against a unit without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, if that model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="3ff1-45ea-280c-111b" name="Savage echoes" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="897f-25a8-7032-e0f4" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="73ee-5c9d-5ddd-7e43" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition type="equalTo" value="0" field="selections" scope="force" childId="4b31-59ac-a27f-ba2b" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit with this tactic fights, if it made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of models in this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="ac2f-f9b0-72ca-f26c" name="Fury within" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="73ee-5c9d-5ddd-7e43" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack against a unit without INORGANIC, VEHICLE or TITANIC Keywords, if that model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attack’s wound roll.
- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack, on an unmodified wound roll of 6, improve the Damage characteristic of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="ac53-44e1-00c2-1a2d" name="Relentless Seekers" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="3eca-492b-8371-402c" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- When resolving an attack made against a unit with this tactic, an unmodified wound roll of 1 or 2 always fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the model making that attack may have.
- When a Psychic test or Deny the Witch test is taken for a PSYKER model with this tactic, re-roll any or all dice rolls of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="01d4-960a-bfaa-d15d" name="Devastating charge" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="5f72-7584-6a50-ed63" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="12f0-57a9-2a5d-af11" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the Assault Doctrine is active, when resolving an attack made with a melee weapon by a model with this ability in a unit that made a charge move or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that weapon for that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="1e72-bd9e-9a5c-748b" name="Lightning assault" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="12f0-57a9-2a5d-af11" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Units with this tactic are eligible to declare a charge with in a turn in which they Advanced or Fell Back.
- Models with this tactic do not suffer the penalty incurred to their hit rolls for firing Assault weapons in the same turn their unit Advanced.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="484e-822b-257b-276d" name="Codex discipline" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="2460-98c3-9419-f02c" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to the Leadership characteristic of models with this tactic.
- Units with this tactic are eligible to shoot in a turn in which they Fell Back, but if they do, then until the end of the turn, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, subtract 1 from that attacks hit roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="0108-f950-3f1f-de6f" name="Scions of Guilliman" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="ancestor" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="6e14-0930-78fa-ed27" type="instanceOf"/>
                  </conditions>
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="and">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="445b-f13f-335b-7c12" type="equalTo"/>
                        <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="2460-98c3-9419-f02c" type="equalTo"/>
                        <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="4481-3ff4-559e-7def" type="equalTo"/>
                        <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="7a95-83e0-5cc9-85a4" type="equalTo"/>
                        <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="0bfd-a983-317b-51ff" type="equalTo"/>
                        <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="1f1e-85f5-7d9a-62ff" type="equalTo"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the Tactical Doctrine is active, models with this ability that moved in your Movement phase, but did not Advance or Fall Back, can make attacks with ranged weapons in the following Shooting phase as if their unit had remained stationary this turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="0bed-5b0a-4230-10f6" name="Redden the earth" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="445b-f13f-335b-7c12" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to Advance rolls and charge rolls made for units with this tactic.
- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack, if that model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="70a0-554f-4924-e5c9" name="Total adherence to the Codex Astartes" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="4481-3ff4-559e-7def" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When using any models with this tactic:
- In your first battle round, only the Devastator Doctrine can be selected.
- In your second and third battle round, only the Tactical Doctrine can be selected.
- From your fourth battle round, only the Assault Doctrine can be selected.
Whilst the Tactical Doctrine is active, models with this tactic consider the Devastator Doctrine to be active as well.
Whilst the Assault Doctrine is active, models with this tactic consider the Tactical Doctrine to be active as well.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="3717-8096-3e01-1dc1" name="The bond martial" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="1f1e-85f5-7d9a-62ff" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack against an INFANTRY or BIKER unit, an unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target.
- Each time a unit with this tactic is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll when resolving that unit’s attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="2ebb-59d1-229a-9735" name="Tome tactics" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="7a95-83e0-5cc9-85a4" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a ranged attack with a bolt weapon, re-roll a hit roll of 1.
- Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for a unit with this tactic, it is automatically passed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="5cce-40bb-a497-e2f9" name="Lightning deployment" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="532d-0d0a-60bd-f226" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- All TRANSPORT units of the CARCHARODONS receive the ASSAULT TRANSPORT keyword.
- Add 2 to movement or charge rolls if the unit has dissembarked from a TRANSPORT or deployed as Reinforcements in the previous Movement phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="4293-89f2-4c79-356d" name="Surgical strikes" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="equalTo" value="0" field="selections" scope="force" childId="4141-2c38-e535-8f37" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When resolving an attack made by a model with this tactic against a CHARACTER unit, you can add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="4182-d65b-6044-c7ec" name="No matter the odds" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="9968-5d45-5101-9a86" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by this unit that target an enemy unit that contains at least twice as many models as their own. For the purposes of this ability, CRIMSON FISTS VEHICLE units from your army count as 5 other models.
- All units with this ability gain Objective Secured ability as described in 9th edition Core Rules.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="f175-3d6c-b51b-22d1" name="Legacy of Dorn" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="9968-5d45-5101-9a86" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="55b9-4b5d-3151-41d7" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="58f3-4dd1-413a-19bb" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="8984-fb64-ce9e-42fe" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the Devastator Doctrine is active, each time a model with this ability makes an attack with a Heavy weapon against a MONSTER, VEHICLE, TITANIC or BUILDING unit, add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="49c9-4e7d-1f45-89c3" name="By my will I deny Thee" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="8984-fb64-ce9e-42fe" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time an attack is made against a unit with this tactic, an unmodified wound roll of 1 or 2 always fails, irrespective of any abilities that the weapon or the attacker may have.
- Each time a model with this tactic would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- All INFANTRY units with this ability gain Objective Secured ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="5ae1-73c5-6fc3-dfbf" name="Siege masters" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="58f3-4dd1-413a-19bb" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="55b9-4b5d-3151-41d7" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a ranged attack, the target does not recieve the benefits of Light Cover against that attack.
- Each time a model with this tactic makes attack with a bolt weapon, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="2761-72bd-7c60-6e24" name="Grim resolve" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="f657-aa75-dcf2-df44" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="1dd9-df44-90d5-052f" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes an attack, if that models unit has remained stationary in the previous movement phase, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll, and you can ignore any or all modifiers to the Hit roll.
- Each time a Combat Attrition test is taken for a unit with this tactic, it is automatically passed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
