                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="c01c-6741-ac91-8bfa" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="ancestor" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="e691-aad7-d21c-1023" type="instanceOf"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="e691-aad7-d21c-1023" type="instanceOf"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tactic lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll 1D6, on a 5+ that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="29bc-9b4e-255b-d3d1" name="The flesh is weak" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" type="instanceOf"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="ancestor" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" type="instanceOf"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="2dac-4ab7-b7f6-a923" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tactic would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost. If the model already has a similar ability, add 1 to the result of the roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="c582-85a5-28ce-bfd0" name="The flesh is weak" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" type="notInstanceOf"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="ancestor" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c8fd-783f-3230-493e" type="notInstanceOf"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="2dac-4ab7-b7f6-a923" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost. If the model already has a similar ability, add 1 to the result of the roll.
- Models with this tactic whose characteristics can change as they suffer damage are considered to have double the number of wounds remaining for the purposes of determining what those characteristics are.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="48eb-6076-882d-8b9d" name="Calculated fury" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="2dac-4ab7-b7f6-a923" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="31fd-24a5-f772-883f" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the Devastator Doctrine is active, when resolving an attack made with a Heavy weapon by a unit with this ability, re-roll wound rolls of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="2f26-0c9a-e90b-056a" name="Forged in battle" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="d29c-a288-fa27-2ac5" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a unit with this tactic is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one wound roll when resolving that unit’s attacks.
- Each time an attack is made against a unit with this tactic, that attack’s wound roll cannot be re-rolled.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="c2fb-7943-3589-ffde" name="Promethean cult" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="d29c-a288-fa27-2ac5" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="f416-94e9-8c57-67b7" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Whilst the Tactical Doctrine is active, when resolving an attack made with a flame weapon or melta weapon by a model with this ability, add 1 to the Wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="f2a6-5131-ef2c-d60d" name="Hunters unleashed" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="3fde-546f-54d3-9266" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model with this tactic makes a melee attack, if that model’s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, add 1 to that attacks hit roll.
- Units with this tactic are eligible to perform Heroic Interventions as if they were CHARACTERS.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="6b95-e9bd-58c0-e89f" name="Dark terror" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="fd82-de03-6ee0-61e8" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Add 1 to Advance rolls and charge rolls made for units with this tactic.
- Each time a ranged attack is made against a unit with this tactic by a model that is more than 18&quot; away, the unit with this tactic is treated as having the benefits of light cover against that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="7d42-dd3d-43d0-e5d5" name="Savage fury" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="3fde-546f-54d3-9266" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="fd82-de03-6ee0-61e8" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a INFANTRY model in this unit makes a melee attack, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="3056-abd0-b7a0-1d8b" name="Attack from the shadows" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="92d2-81ad-db8d-4ef3" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Enemy units cannot fire OVERWATCH against LORDS OF ASHES INFANTRY units if they begin the charge at 7&quot; or more.
- LORDS OF ASHES INFANTRY units ignore terrain movement penalty during charges.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="635a-c866-cd32-6ce4" name="Born anew" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="35d2-4571-5822-203a" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your Warlord is from TERCIO ULTIMA, you can select two Combat Doctrines to be active in your Command Phase instead of one.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="a475-4b24-af23-c782" name="Seasoned warriors" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="94c5-eb87-152e-ce4e" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a GILDED ONE unit fights, if it made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved, the unit ignore all hit penalty modifiers, and fight first in that phase. If a enemy unit has an ability that makes to fight last, this ability nullifies it and both has no effect.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="7115-3155-ba29-b0a2" name="Veterans of the Chapter" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="549e-4e37-8664-3b0a" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">TERCIO GRANDE INFANTRY units ignore the penalty of movement and fire HEAVY class weapons. TERCIO GRANDE units also can advance and fire ASSAULT class weaponary without penalty, or fire HEAVY, PISTOL or RAPID FIRE weaponary with a -1 penalty to hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="5906-2d4f-5d18-3cc7" name="Whispers of the Machine Spirit" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="8dc8-22d1-144d-7763" type="equalTo"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- In your COMMAND PHASE, IGNIS KEPEER VEHICLE units with this ability recover 1 wound.
- IGNIS KEPEER VEHICLE  units which did not move in the precedent movement phase, re-roll a hit roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="d457-c572-16b1-1ad8" name="The Aegis" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="or">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="c01c-6741-ac91-8bfa" type="equalTo"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="e691-aad7-d21c-1023" type="notInstanceOf"/>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="ancestor" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="e691-aad7-d21c-1023" type="notInstanceOf"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model with this tactic lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll 1D6, on a 5+ that wound is not lost. In addition, add 1 to Deny the Witch test for PSYKER units.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shadow masters" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities" hidden="true" id="8808-58a2-140a-8ed5">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a ranged attack targets a unit with this tactic, if the attacker is more than 9&quot; away, subtract 1 from that attack’s hit roll.
- Each time a ranged attack targets a INFANTRY or BIKER unit with this tactic, while benefitting of cover and 9&quot; away from the attacking enemy unit, a hit roll of 1-3 for that attack fails.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
