                <profile id="9fe2-8267-16d9-1c0f" name="Soothing rage" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of each Fight phase, if this model has destroyed at least one enemy model during that phase, it regains one Wound. If a one of the destroyed models had the CHARACTER or MONSTER Keyword, it regains all the lost Wounds.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile id="9715-7b6f-2872-f32f" name="Laurels of Victory" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">After the beginning of the Battle, if this model is on the Battlefield you can reduce the cost of either Cycle of War or Sons of Gilliman Stratagems to 0CP once in each Battle round.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
