            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this unit does not contain a WOLF GUARD model, then each time this unit declares a charge, you must select the closest eligible enemy unit as one of the targets of that charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="fce6-2c81-b309-0c67" name="Berserk Charge" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time it fights, if it made a charge move this turn, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the models in this unit.</characteristic>
