                <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Bomb. The affected units suffers D3 mortal wounds and is caught in stasis until the start of your next turn. While a unit (excluding VEHICLE and MONSTER units) is caught in stasis, it cannot Fall Back.</characteristic>
