      <profiles>
        <profile id="ad38-57ba-9a30-e41d" name="Defensive Array" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- In your Shooting phase, each time this model is selected to shoot, it&apos;s Assault Cannon or its Twin missile launcher can target, and resolve attacks against up to 5 eligible enemy units. 
- Each time a enemy unit declares a charge against this unit, if is not in engagement range of other enemy units, it can fire Overwatch.
- Each time this model fires Overwatch, it only resolves attacks with it&apos;s weapons against the charging unit, but when doing so the Type of it&apos;s Assault Cannon is changed to Heavy 12, and the type of it&apos;s Twin missile launcher is changed to Heavy 4 (Krak) // Heavy 4D6 (Frag).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="1f82-15e0-fc0a-1aa6" name="Drop Pod" hidden="false" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="0bdf-a96e-9e38-7779">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="e7f0-1278-0250-df0c">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="381b-eb28-74c3-df5f">3+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="2218-aa3c-265f-2939">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="9c9f-9774-a358-3a39">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="f330-5e6e-4110-0978">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="13fc-b29b-31f2-ab9f">-</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="00ca-f8b8-876d-b705">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Save" typeId="c0df-df94-abd7-e8d3">3+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile id="a8cd-1d35-bb98-8be7" name="Drop Pod Assault" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- This unit must start the battle set up high in the skies, but is not counted towards any limits that the mission you are playing places on the maximum number of Reinforcements units you can have in your army. 
- This unit can be set up in the Reinforcements step of your first, second or third Movement phase, regardless of any mission rules, and they must set up more than 6+D3&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
