        <profile id="bdaa-fe34-9599-5d5a" name="Sokar-pattern Stormbird" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">- This model has a transport capacity of 50 &lt;CHAPTER&gt; INFANTRY models.
- Each JUMP PACK, WULFEN or TERMINATOR model takes the space of two INFANTRY models and each CENTURION model takes the space of three INFANTRY models. 
- It can transport BIKER models, each one takes the space of 3 INFANTRY models.
- It can transport one RHINO model, which, including units embarked within it, takes the space of 25 INFANTRY models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
