        <profile id="b86a-6848-0135-6131" name="Stormraven Gunship" hidden="false" typeId="b3a8-0452-7436-44d1" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="15aa-1916-a38b-d223">- This model has a transport capacity of 12 &lt;CHAPTER&gt; INFANTRY models and 1 &lt;CHAPTER&gt; DREADNOUGHT model. 
- Each JUMP PACK, WULFEN or TERMINATOR model takes the space of two INFANTRY models and each CENTURION model takes the space of three INFANTRY models. 
- It can transport BIKER models, each one takes the space of three INFANTRY models.
- It cannot transport DREADNOUGHT models that have a Wounds characteristic of 10 or more.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
