                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your Movement phase, when an ADEPTUS ASTARTES JET-PACK, BIKER, LAND SPEEDER or STORM SPEEDER unit from your army Falls Back. That unit is still eligible to shoot or charge this turn even though it Fell Back.</characteristic>
