                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your Psychic phase. Select one BLOOD ANGELS PSYKER unit from your army. You can attempt to manifest one additional psychic power with that unit this phase.</characteristic>
