                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your opponent’s Psychic phase, after a Psychic test is passed for an enemy PSYKER unit. Select one SPACE WOLVES unit from your army within 12&quot; of that PSYKER unit. The unit you selected can attempt to deny that psychic power by taking a Deny the Witch test as if they were a PSYKER.</characteristic>
