                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your opponent’s Psychic phase, before a Deny the Witch test is taken for a GREY KNIGHTS PSYKER unit from your army. When taking that test, roll one additional D6 and discard the lowest result.</characteristic>
