                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your Shooting phase, when a DEATHWATCH INFANTRY CORE unit from your army is selected to shoot. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack against an enemy unit, an unmodified hit roll of 3+ is always sucessfull  irrespective of any abilities that the unit receiving the attack may have.</characteristic>
