                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Use this Stratagem in your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an IMPERIAL FISTS unit from your army is chosen to shoot or fight with. Until the end of that phase, when resolving an attack made by a model in that unit against a BUILDING or VEHICLE unit, add 1 to the hit roll and add 1 to the wound roll.</characteristic>
