                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;CHAPTER&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, that unit has the Objective Secured ability. If a model in such a unit already has this ability, that model counts as if were with one additional wound when determining control of an objective marker.</characteristic>
