              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" childId="ad68-c80e-d058-88b7" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="01bb-2cfa-14a5-6967" name="TL: 1. Absolute focus" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="ee7a-0478-0098-0ece" type="max"/>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" id="6332-de33-d1c4-fab1" type="max"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile id="acb1-f83d-9470-9b47" name="Absolute focus [Aura]" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, add 6&quot; to the casting range of psychic powers for this warlord, aura type powers increase it&apos;s range by 3&quot;.
- If this WARLORD has not the PSYKER keyword, ECLIPSE GUARD units at 9&quot; of this WARLORD can re-roll morale tests.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="aed5-f13d-0f47-503e" name="TL: 2. Warp currents Watcher" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="db30-4926-bfac-3f70" type="max"/>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" id="305b-1ad1-f42a-4445" type="max"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile id="0b32-0f42-cda6-bbb2" name="Warp currents Watcher [Aura]" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <modifiers>
                        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" childId="a1be-ee90-b5b3-388d" type="atLeast"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </modifier>
                      </modifiers>
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- During the Psychic phase, each time a ECLIPSE GUARD INFANTRY model at 9&quot; of this WARLORD loses a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, add 1 to any Deny the Witch test taken by this WARLORD. If this WARLORD does not have the PSYKER keyword, in your opponent’s Psychic phase, this WARLORD can attempt to Deny the Witch once as if it were a PSYKER model.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                    <profile id="c1e8-32f8-b1c5-d95d" name="Warp currents Watcher [Aura]" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <modifiers>
                        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                          <conditions>
                            <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" childId="ad68-c80e-d058-88b7" type="atLeast"/>
                          </conditions>
                        </modifier>
                      </modifiers>
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- During the Psychic phase, each time a DEATHWATCH INFANTRY model at 9&quot; of this WARLORD loses a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.
- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, add 1 to any Deny the Witch test taken by this WARLORD. If this WARLORD does not have the PSYKER keyword, in your opponent’s Psychic phase, this WARLORD can attempt to Deny the Witch once as if it were a PSYKER model.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="7605-9b75-2829-5d0b" name="TL: 3. Will suppressor" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="a5de-1515-4d06-b87e" type="max"/>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" id="ffe5-968c-0d6b-bf60" type="max"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile id="f29f-caa1-3b15-0da0" name="Will Suppressor [Aura]" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- If this WARLORD has the PSYKER keyword, each time this WARLORD is selected to Deny the witch, it can roll an additional D6, and discard the one with the lowest result.
- If this WARLORD has not the PSYKER keyword, enemy units within 9&quot; of this WARLORD add 1 to Atrittion test rolls.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
            <selectionEntryGroup id="0860-017c-a20d-2436" name="Warlord Traits (Ignis&apos; Keepers)" hidden="true" collective="false" import="true">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="force" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" childId="8dc8-22d1-144d-7763" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry id="1bf0-c2b1-a17e-83c5" name="TL: 1. Ballistics mastery" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" id="b139-d5dd-dc68-d021" type="max"/>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="47d4-618d-601c-adad" type="max"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile id="0c6c-4830-f802-28e3" name="Ballistics mastery" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During your Command phase, select a IGNIS KEEPERS VEHICLE within 6&quot; of this WARLORD, until your next command phase, add 1 to the Hit rolls, and during each phase, that unit can re-roll: a roll determining the number of attacks made by a weapon, a Hit roll, a Wound roll, and a Damage roll.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="fd1d-4e23-b805-134c" name="TL: 2. Fire on my Mark" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" id="a456-789a-e59f-8c41" type="max"/>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="25ef-9461-312b-e464" type="max"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <profiles>
                    <profile id="9434-b4e1-539c-5abd" name="Fire on my Mark" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the beggining of each shooting phase, this WARLORD can select one enemy MONSTER, VEHICLE, TITANIC or BUILDING unit at 36&quot; and visible to it. Add 1 to the Strength characteristic of Attacks made by IGNIS KEEPERS VEHICLE units against that target.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="CP" typeId="2d3b-b544-ad49-fb75" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="Pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
                    <cost name="RP" typeId="ed03-25cc-2681-bdce" value="0"/>
                  </costs>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry id="33e3-8520-dc1d-3f1b" name="TL: 3. Flanking speed" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="true" id="61bb-afdf-98a2-4720" type="max"/>
                    <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="d5be-7c2c-08c6-bf56" type="max"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <profiles>
