                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- At the beggining of the Movement phase, IGNIS KEEPER VEHICLE units at 6&quot; of this WARLORD (or the unit this WARLORD is embarked on) add 3&quot; to their Movement characteristic. 
- IGNIS KEEPER TRANSPORT units at 6&quot; of this WARLORD (or the unit this WARLORD is embarked on) gains the ASSAULT TRANSPORT Keyword.</characteristic>
