                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this WARLORD makes a melee attack, you can re-roll the hit roll and improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1.</characteristic>
