                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this WARLORD is within Engagement Range of any enemy models with a Leadership characteristic of 7 or less, add 2 to its Attacks characteristic.</characteristic>
