                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Friendly ULTRAMARINES INFANTRY units and ULTRAMARINES BIKER units can perform a Heroic Intervention as if they were CHARACTERS whilst they are within 6&quot; of this WARLORD.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
