                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- BIKER only. If you are randomly generating your WARLORD’s Warlord Trait and your WARLORD is not a BIKER, re-roll this result until a different Warlord Trait is generated. 
- When a charge roll is made for this WARLORD, you can re-roll the dice. 
- When resolving an attack against this WARLORD, subtract 1 from the hit roll if this Warlord Advanced in your previous Movement phase.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
