                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When an enemy unit (other than a unit that contains a model with a minimum Move characteristic) within Engagement Range of this WARLORD is chosen to Fall Back, you can roll one D6: on a 4+, that unit cannot Fall Back this turn.</characteristic>
