                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a CARCHARODONS CORE or CARCHARODONS CHARACTER units make a melee attack at 6&quot; from this WARLORD, add 1 to the strenght characteristic of that attack.</characteristic>
