                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a CARCHARODONS CORE or CARCHARODONS CHARACTER units make a melee attack within 9&quot; from this WARLORD, against an enemy INFANTRY or BEAST model,  re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
