                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a Psychic test is taken for this WARLORD, if the result of that test was an unmodified result of 8+ and it was greater than or equal to that power’s warp charge value, your opponent cannot attempt to deny that power.</characteristic>
