              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Shooting phase, each time this model is selected to shoot its Hull weapon array can target, and resolve attacks against up to 8 eligible enemy unit. 
Each time this model fires Overwatch, it only resolves attacks with its weapons against the charging unit, but when doing so the Type of its heavy bolter is changed to Heavy 6, and the Type of its heavy flamer is changed to Heavy 2D6.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
