                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model knows one additional Litany. In your Command phase, if this model is on the battlefield, it can recite on additional Litany it knows that has not already been recited by a friendly model that turn.</characteristic>
