              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time this model repairs a model using its Blessing of the Omnissiah ability, that model regains up to 3 lost wounds instead of D3</characteristic>
