                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Tenebrous Curse has a warp charge value of 7. If manifested, select one enemy unit that cannot Fly and is within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER.
- That unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
- Halve that unit&apos;s Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Advance rolls and Charge rolls made for it.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
