                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">18&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Mind Raid has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one enemy model within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER.
- That model&apos;s unit suffers 1 mortal wound.
- If that model is a CHARACTER, roll 3D6: if the result is equal to or greater than that model&apos;s Leadership characteristic, you gain 1 Command Point.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
