                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd64-cbc4-94de-24cc">Self</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Vigour Leech has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested:
- Until the start of your next Psychic phase, non-friendly units within 6&quot; of this Psyker have their Strength characteristic reduced by 1.
- While one or more enemy units are affected by this power, the Psyker unit add 1 to the Strenght characteristic of the Pysker models it contain.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
