                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: Warp Shaping has a Warp charge value of 4. If manifested, select one Tide of the Warp that has not been dominant for your army during this battle. Your army&apos;s currently dominant Tide of the Warp is changed to the selected Tide of the Warp.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
