                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Ghostly Bonds has a Warp charge value of 5. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this Psyker. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, halve that unit&apos;s Move characterstic</characteristic>
