                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Draconic Aspect has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, then until the start of your next Psychic phase, subtract 2 from the Leadership characteristic of models in enemy units whilst their unit is within 12&quot; of this PSYKER.</characteristic>
