                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Malediction: Spirits of Chogoris has a Warp charge value of 6. If manifested, select one enemy unit within 18&quot; of and visible to this PSYKER. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, subtract 1 from the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit, and when resolving an attack made by a model in that unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
