                    <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Witchfire: Psychic Cleanse has a warp charge value of 6. If manifested, roll one D6 for each enemy model within 9&quot; of this PSYKER; on a 6, that model&apos;s unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
