            <profile id="c885-7f81-5fbf-eed9" name="Watcher in the Dark" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, this model can attempt to Deny the Witch as if it were a PSYKER. If the model attempting to manifest the psychic power is a CHAOS PSYKER, you can re-roll that Deny the Witch test.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="de8e-4cb0-020b-636c" name="Supreme Tactician" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged and this model is your WARLORD, you receive an additional 2 Command points.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="2e2a-c145-d05f-1e6f" name="Lion Helm [Aura]" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly DARK ANGELS INFANTRY or DARK ANGELS BIKER unit is within 6&quot; of this model, models in that unit have a 4+ invulnerable save against ranged attacks.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
