                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer fights, can made 2 additional attacks with this weapon, and no more than 2 attacks can be made by this weapon per fight phase. If the target of a attack made by this weapon is not a VEHICLE, MONSTER, BUILDING or TITANIC, a wound roll of 2+ always wound the target.</characteristic>
