              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">INFANTRY models in friendly IRON HANDS units have a 5+ invulnerable save whilst their unit is within 6&quot; of this model.</characteristic>
