              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly SPACE WOLVES CORE unit is within 9&quot; of this model, models in that unit can use this model’s Leadership characteristic instead of their own.</characteristic>
