            <profile id="4071-3f06-49ba-9dc1" name="Forgefather" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, select one friendly SALAMANDERS CORE or SALAMANDERS CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes an attack with a flame or melta weapon, you can re-roll that attack’s hit roll and you can re-roll that attack’s wound roll.</characteristic>
