                    <characteristic name="S" typeId="59b1-319e-ec13-d466">7</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="AP" typeId="75aa-a838-b675-6484">-3</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">3</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">If the weapon&apos;s bearer is in engagement range of enemy units, this weapon changes it&apos;s profile to Pistol 2. Add 1 to the Wound rolls. For each unmodified hit rolls of 1 are made for attacks with this weapon profile, the bearer suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
