              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">After this model finishes a charge move, you can select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of it and roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound.</characteristic>
