                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, in your opponents Shooting phase, when the bearer is selected as the target of a ranged attacks it can activate this relic. 
If it does, remove the bearer from the battlefield and then set it back up on the battlefield, anywhere this is more than 9&quot; away from an enemy model. If the beaerer is no longer an eligible target, your opponent can then select new eligible targets for the ranged attacks.</characteristic>
