                        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time and attack is made with this weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 6 (or 4+ if the target is a CHAOS DAEMON unit) inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage</characteristic>
