                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of each battle round, select one friendly IRON HANDS VEHICLE unit within 3&quot; of the bearer. 
Until the start of your next battle round, when resolving an attack made against that Vehicle unit, if the bearer is within 3&quot; of that Vehicle unit you can reduce any damage suffered by 1, to a minimum of 1 (this is not cumulative with any other rules that reduce damage).</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
