                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, when resolving an attack made by a model from your army with this Relic, you can re-roll the hit roll, wound roll or damage roll. In addition, if a model from your army with this Relic is destroyed as a result of an attack made by an enemy unit, then until the end of the battle, when resolving an attack made by a friendly RAVEN GUARDunit against that enemy unit, add 1 to the hit roll</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                  <costs>
                    <cost name="PL" typeId="e356-c769-5920-6e14" value="0"/>
