                        <characteristic name="D" typeId="ae8a-3137-d65b-4ca7">-</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer fights, it makes 2 additional attacks with this weapon. Each time an attack is made with this weapon, if the wound roll is successful, the target suffers 1 mortal wound and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
