                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- The bearer has a Save characteristic of 2+ and a 4+ invulnerable save.
- At the start of the Fight phase, you can select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of the bearer. That unit is not eligible to fight this phase until after all eligible units from your army have done so.</characteristic>
