                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When resolving an attack made with a melee weapon by a model with this Relic against a unit that is not a VEHICLE or TITANIC, a wound roll of 2+ is always successful.</characteristic>
