                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When you give a model this Relic, select one bolt weapon that model is equipped with. 
When the bearer shoots with that weapon, you can choose for it to fire haywire bolts.
When resolving that attacks, if it is made against a VEHICLE unit, an unmodified wound roll of 4-5 inflicts D3 mortal wounds on the target in addition to any other damage, and an unmodified wound roll of 6 inflicts 3 mortal wounds on the target in addition to any other damage.</characteristic>
