                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time a model in this unit makes an attack against an enemy unit with the Elites Battlefield Role, re-roll a wound roll of 1.
- If you selected the Elites Battlefield Role for the Xenos Hunters Chapter Tactic, each time a model in this unit makes an attack against an enemy unit with that Battlefield Role, you can re-roll the wound roll.</characteristic>
